---

Third-party components:

* PyMuPDF (AGPL-3.0) — PDF parsing and image extraction.
* ReportLab (BSD-3-Clause) — PDF generation with CJK fonts.
* Argos Translate (MIT) / CTranslate2 (MIT) — offline machine translation engine.
* Argos en→zh model (CC-BY-4.0, from OPUS data) — downloaded at build time.
* Microsoft YaHei (msyh.ttc) — NOT bundled; the program uses the font installed
  on Windows for Chinese text. On other systems it falls back to what is available.
